  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Formulation Fund will allow FAO to: establish Agri-accelerators in the Gambia while simultaneously exploring new pathways for agile and adaptive Agri-accelerator approaches; work towards the creation of a Pan-African cohort of Master Coaches skilled in the RAI Accelerator Toolkit; and develop a guide on agri-accelerator pathways.</narrative>
